18. What is Redux? Why do we need Redux?
Redux is a predictable state-management library.
It provides a centralized store where application state can be managed.
Basic flow:
Component
    ↓
dispatch(action)
    ↓
Reducer
    ↓
Store updated
    ↓
Component receives new state
Example:
